Error [E3410]: `core.files.read()` is a Tier-2 comptime effect — it requires a `#Impure` gate
  --> tests/ui/impure_tier2_no_gate.jet:4:23
    |
  4 |     comptime cfg = fs.read("config.txt")
    |                       ^^^^
 Why: ambient I/O (filesystem, environment, process) is not allowed in pure comptime evaluation
 Fix: wrap the comptime binding in `#Impure("reason") { … }` and pass `--allow-impure` to the build

Error [E0915]: `String ? IOError` has no `Display` implementation
  --> tests/ui/impure_tier2_no_gate.jet:5:13
    |
  5 |     print("{cfg}")
    |             ^^^
 Why: bare `{value}` interpolation calls `Display` — there is no default for user types
 Fix: add `impl String ? IOError.Display { fn display(self) -> String { … } }`, or use `{value@Debug}` for debug output
